Starweave Java Agent

This module ports the behavior of Starweave's embedded Pi integration and the
minimal agent loop, session, skills and compaction concepts from Pi 0.75.3.
Upstream: https://github.com/earendil-works/pi-mono
Pinned source commit: a7d8dd3d5db7d66aa5cc6886e32768b1196ce91f

